{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#card-zh","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"lgtm-dsh 是面向 DSH Web 的测试质量审查插件，通过组合配置接入两个 agent 工具，并在插件设置卡片中选择保存 TypeSafe 凭据的模型路由。它可先检查审查工具和凭据是否就绪，再估算审查范围、输入量、费用与运行时间，并生成测试问题及检查说明。适合希望判断测试是否真正验证行为、或为代码改动补充测试的开发者；运行实际审查需要 TypeSafe 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:919-955","index.js:473-515","client/client.js:257-270"]}
{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#card-en","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"lgtm-dsh reviews test quality in DSH Web. Its tools check readiness, estimate audit cost, and report findings. The settings card selects a TypeSafe credential route. It helps developers check whether tests verify behavior and improve them after code changes. Real audits need a TypeSafe credential.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:919-955","index.js:473-515","client/client.js:257-270"]}
