{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#feature-status","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"lgtm-dsh 的功能「状态检查」：调用 lgtm_status 可检查 lgtm 命令行工具是否已安装，以及所选 TypeSafe 凭据引用能否解析；返回就绪状态和需要处理的提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:365-390"]}
