{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#feature-audit","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"lgtm-dsh 的功能「测试审查」：调用 lgtm_audit 可审查测试代码是否真正验证实现，并返回触发的检查项、文件位置、置信度和解释；可指定目标文件或目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:473-515"]}
{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#feature-settings","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"lgtm-dsh 的功能「模型路由选择」：在插件设置卡片中选择保存 TypeSafe 凭据的模型路由并保存；卡片展示可用路由，支持暂存修改和放弃更改。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:300-340"]}
{"unit_id":"dymzz__lgtm-dsh#caveat-typesafe","repo":"dymzz/lgtm-dsh","commit":"f092ed8968f63b69f6ca3b099f908780759cbfbb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"lgtm-dsh 的实际审查使用 TypeSafe 的 Jev 模型，需要所选 DSH 凭据路由提供 TypeSafe API 凭据；计划预估模式不调用模型。见 index.js:342-350、index.js:473-491。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:342-350","index.js:473-491"]}
